# User Landing Directory - Git Ignore
#
# By default, ignore everything in user/ directory to keep personal files private.
# This allows users to store project-specific files, symlinks, and configurations
# without accidentally committing them to the repository.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# But track these files
!README.md
!.gitignore

# Track example templates if you create any
!*-example.yaml
!*-example.sh
!*-example.md

# Explicitly ignore common patterns
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.secrets/
